{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56729","headline":"七言不全诗句石刻 · 无名氏","name":"七言不全诗句石刻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一瓶寒水背书囊。\n（见《安阳县金石录》卷四。\n）（〖1〗《安阳县金石录》：「案《禹璜题名》上有不全诗句，第一行存『往』字，第二行存『石』字，存『』字，三行存『一瓶寒水）-（背书囊』七字，另行存『七言』字，盖後人磨治。\n书类欧阳率更，亦唐人佳刻也。\n」按：《禹璜题名》在灵泉寺佛殿前西塔，咸通八年刻。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}